    "text": "EFFECTS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 3, CC 17 to 32\n   1 Wind\n   2 Chaos\n   3 Cloth reacts\n   4 Impacts per beat\n   5 Breaks\n   6 Settle time\n   7 Weight\n   8 Fur length\n   9 Clumping\n  10 Frizz\n  11 Hair color\n  12 Shine\n  13 Fur reacts to\n  14 Fur lag\n  15 Element\n  16 Thickness\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 3, CC 33 to 47\n   1 Growth\n   2 Curl\n   3 Splash\n   4 Scattered things\n   5 Fire lights the scene\n   6 suite: Storm\n   7 suite: Hearth\n   8 suite: Brawl\n   9 suite: Slow motion\n  10 suite: Drenched\n  11 suite: Backlit fluff\n  12 suite: Windblown\n  13 suite: Avalanche\n  14 suite: Drift\n  15 pair: When impacts rise, the shake rises"
